  "translation": "Na long Adam em i tok: Bilong wanem yu harim tok bilong meri bilong yu, na yu kaikai long diwai we mi bin givim tok bilong yu, mi tok: Yu no ken kaikai long em — graun i kros bilong yu; long pen wok bilong yu yu bai kaikai long em, olgeta dei bilong laip bilong yu.",
